{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join 'Hunter' and his Syndicate, through Brutal combat. As he discovers the secrets of Earths existence, and life's true meaning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn real-world information and advice. Expand your knowledge as you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a Formidable Soldier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to 3v3 Turn-Based Combat, Unlocking new companions, Abilities, and Items, over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cook recipes using any random 2-4 Ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct and customize your Syndicates Base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/_BG_AttackMove__SteamDisplay_Collection_.png?t=1745428666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Prologue</strong> Story Arc &amp; <strong>The Plains</strong> Story Arc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100's of Unique Cinematic Comic Panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/MH_Squirrel_GIF.gif?t=1745428666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465850?t=1745428666","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465850?t=1745428666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/abe831352cba30102cdfae7e84de69724ea54946/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745428666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a